<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>NgSharp</PackageId>
    <Version>3.0.0</Version>
    <Authors>Nayruu</Authors>
    <Description>Interpreted Angular-style HTML template engine for .NET — no runtime compilation, so it runs under Native AOT, trimming, Azure Functions and C# scripts where Razor-based engines can't. Thread-safe immutable AST, pipes, directives, server components, [if]/[for]/[not-empty] and @if/@else/@for control-flow, &amp;&amp; / || conditions, and per-template AST caching. Zero third-party dependencies — a purpose-built HTML template parser produces structurally-correct, escaped output.</Description>
    <PackageTags>template html rendering angular pipes directives components ssr razorless lightweight aot trimming serverless functions zero-dependency</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>3.0 — the V3 engine.

Fused single-pass parser, lazy zero-copy model reads, monomorphic inline
caches, span-formatted pipes: the fastest of six benchmarked .NET template
engines, warm and cold, in time and allocations, with byte-identical output.

NEW
- @switch / @case / @default control-flow block (both dialects)
- TemplateOptions: one options record on every call (mode, strict, culture, limits)
- Strict mode + Validate() diagnostics; silent failures become NgSharpException — including statically-detectable always-false conditions and literal division by zero
- TemplateMode.Text: plain-text / JSON / CSV output through the same pipeline
- TextWriter sinks + RenderAsync: awaited writes, atomic (a throwing render writes nothing)
- $index / $count / $first / $last loop variables; per-render culture; RenderLimits caps
- &lt;ng-template&gt; / @render fragments; transparent ng-container; @for (x of items)
- [else-if] / [else] attribute chains; complex-type component property binding
- 7 new built-in pipes (default, currency, lower, truncate, join, titlecase, pad) + [empty] directive

BREAKING (each with its remedy in the README, section "Migrating from 2.x")
- HtmlBuilder.Default removed: use Create() and keep the instance you register on
- BuildFromTemplateAsync wrappers removed: rendering is synchronous
- MinifyHtml and Token removed
- FromObject / FromJson lose their unused parent/key parameters
- FromJson reads the JsonElement lazily: Clone() an element that outlives its JsonDocument
- NgElement.Key always returns string.Empty
- The built-in pipes are sealed</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Nayruuu/NgSharp</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/Nayruuu/NgSharp</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <RootNamespace>NgSharp</RootNamespace>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.1;net8.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <!-- File-scoped namespaces (team convention) need C# 10+; every feature used is syntax-only, so
         the netstandard2.1 target compiles identically. -->
    <LangVersion>12</LangVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Ship the XML doc comments in the package (IntelliSense for consumers). CS1591 is not an error:
       the public API is documented, internals need not be. -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS1591</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Run the trim / Native-AOT analyzers on the net8.0 build so AOT-safety is self-verified. -->
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net8.0'">
    <IsAotCompatible>true</IsAotCompatible>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- net8.0 gets System.Text.Json from the shared framework — referencing the package there would
       only add a redundant nuspec dependency. Only netstandard2.1 needs the package. -->
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.1'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="9.0.7" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="NgSharp.Tests" />
    <!-- The benchmark measures the internal warm-render path (TemplateParser/TemplateRenderer). -->
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="NgSharp.Benchmark" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Single source of truth: the repository-root README ships in the package. -->
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
